    sound Lets you drop individual voices in and out of a rhythm without losing their settings.

group Lane 7
L7Steps     "L7 steps"          1 32   16   int 0                               | Lane 7 step count (1 … 32)
    how Sets how many steps lane 7 cycles through before wrapping around, from 1 to 32.
    sound Lengths that do not divide 16 create polymetric rhythms that shift against the bar.
L7Pulses    "L7 pulses"         0 32   0    int 0                               | Lane 7 Euclidean hit count (0 … steps)
    how Sets how many hits lane 7 distributes evenly across its steps via Bjorklund's algorithm (clamped to steps).
    sound Zero silences the main ring while higher values build denser grooves up to every step.
L7Rot       "L7 rotation"       0 31   0    int 0                               | Lane 7 step rotation (0 … steps − 1)
    how Shifts lane 7's Euclidean hits forward around its step ring by this many steps (clamped to steps minus 1).
    sound Rotating shifts downbeats into off-beats and locks interlocking lanes around each other.
L7Chance    "L7 chance"         0 100  100  int 0 %                             | Lane 7 per-hit probability (0 … 100 %)
    how Sets the probability that each active step on lane 7 fires its note, from 0 to 100 %.
    sound Lowering chance drops occasional hits for breathing, evolving percussion.
L7AccPulses "L7 accent pulses"  0 32   0    int 0                               | Lane 7 Euclidean accent count (0 … steps)
    how Sets how many steps in lane 7's second Euclidean accent ring use the accent velocity (clamped to steps).
    sound Accents emphasize selected hits so grooves push and pull dynamically.
L7AccRot    "L7 accent rot"     0 31   0    int 0                               | Lane 7 accent ring rotation (0 … steps − 1)
    how Shifts lane 7's accent ring forward around its steps by this many steps (clamped to steps minus 1).
    sound Moving the accent ring changes which hits pop forward without changing the rhythm itself.
L7Note      "L7 note"           0 127  43   int 0 note                          | Lane 7 MIDI note number (0 … 127)
    how Chooses the MIDI note number lane 7 sends on the note port, from 0 to 127.
    sound Maps the lane to a drum voice in Neo Drums or a pitch on any synth.
L7Vel       "L7 velocity"       1 127  95   int 0                               | Lane 7 normal hit velocity (1 … 127)
    how Sets the MIDI velocity sent for non-accented hits on lane 7, from 1 to 127.
    sound Lower velocities sit quietly as ghost notes and higher values hit harder.
L7AccVel    "L7 accent vel"     1 127  122  int 0                               | Lane 7 accented hit velocity (1 … 127)
    how Sets the MIDI velocity sent when a hit on lane 7 lands on an accented step, from 1 to 127.
    sound Setting this above the base velocity makes accented steps punch through the groove.
L7Gate      "L7 gate"           5 100  60   int 0 %                             | Lane 7 note gate length (5 … 100 % of step)
    how Sets how long each note from lane 7 is held as a share of its step slot, from 5 to 100 %.
    sound Short gates make tight percussive stabs and long gates let synth notes sustain across the step.
L7Ratchet   "L7 ratchet"        1 4    1    int 0                               | Lane 7 repeats inside one step (1 … 4)
    how Subdivides a firing step on lane 7 into 1 to 4 rapid evenly spaced repeats when ratchet chance passes.
    sound Adds crisp snare rolls, hi-hat flurries and rapid melodic trills inside the beat.
L7RatchetCh "L7 ratchet chance" 0 100  100  int 0 %                             | Lane 7 probability of ratcheting a firing hit (0 … 100 %)
    how Sets the probability that a firing hit on lane 7 triggers its ratchet repeats, from 0 to 100 %.
    sound Moderate values add occasional surprise rolls without cluttering every hit.
L7Div       "L7 divider"        0 3    0    enum 1x 2x 3x 4x                    | Lane 7 clock divider (1x … 4x slower)
    how Divides the global step rate for lane 7 by 1, 2, 3 or 4 so the lane steps more slowly.
    sound Slower dividers anchor bass notes and slow accents underneath fast percussion lanes.
L7Ch        "L7 channel"        1 16   1    int 0                               | Lane 7 MIDI channel (1 … 16)
    how Selects the MIDI channel lane 7 tags onto its outgoing note messages, from 1 to 16.
    sound Useful when wiring to multi-channel instruments or splitting channels across targets.
L7Mute      "L7 mute"           0 1    0    switch                              | Mutes lane 7 (stops hits and fills)
    how Silences lane 7, immediately releasing any sounding note it owns and blocking both hits and fills.
    sound Lets you drop individual voices in and out of a rhythm without losing their settings.

