group Clock
Sync        "Timing"            0 1    0    enum Song_tempo Free_time           | Whether steps follow the song's tempo or run on a time in milliseconds
    id timing
    how Chooses between steps locked to the song's tempo and steps of a fixed length in milliseconds.
    sound Song tempo keeps the rhythm in time with the music; Free time runs at its own speed, whatever the tempo.
FreeMs      "Free time"         20 2000 125 lin 20 2000 ms 0                    | The length of a step in milliseconds when Timing is Free time (20 … 2000)
    id free_ms
    how Sets the step length in milliseconds, from 20 to 2000, when Timing is Free time.
    sound Short times run a fast, tempo-independent rhythm; long ones a slow, spacious one.
